# Authentication Audit

Verify:

* Passwords are hashed using bcrypt or equivalent
* No plaintext password storage
* JWT tokens are securely generated
* Access tokens expire
* Refresh tokens expire
* Tokens cannot be forged
* Logout invalidates tokens
* Token revocation works
* Secrets are stored in environment variables
* Sensitive information is never exposed in responses

Fix any issue found.

---

# RBAC Audit

Verify:

* Every protected endpoint checks authentication
* Every protected endpoint checks authorization
* Role escalation is impossible
* Customers cannot access reviewer endpoints
* Customers cannot access admin endpoints
* Employees cannot access admin endpoints
* Reviewers cannot manage users

Fix any issue found.

Generate decorators if missing.

Example:

@role_required("admin")

@role_required("reviewer")

@role_required("employee", "admin")

