# Warranty Audit

Verify:

Warranty calculations are correct.

Review:

product_age

warranty_remaining

warranty_status

Expected behavior:

IF expiry_date > today
THEN status = Active

IF expiry_date <= 30 days
THEN status = Near Expiry

IF expiry_date < today
THEN status = Expired

IF extended_warranty = true
THEN status = Extended Warranty

Fix all calculation errors.

